# ==============================================================================
# Project Anvil - CODEOWNERS
# .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# This file specifies individuals or teams responsible for reviewing code
# in specific parts of the codebase. When a pull request modifies code
# owned by a designated owner, that owner's review is automatically
# requested and required before the PR can be merged, as enforced by
# branch protection rules.
#
# Organization: AcmeLabsCloud
#
# Author: Carrick Bradley
# Last Updated: 2025-09-24
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default Owners
# All files not explicitly covered below will require review from the SRE Team.
# This ensures that all changes have a baseline review.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Layer-Specific Owners
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Bootstrap Layer
# Changes to foundational resources (state, locks, core IAM) are critical
# and should be reviewed by the SRE team.
/bootstrap/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# Network Layer
# Core networking changes are handled by the SRE team.
/network/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# Platform Layer
# Shared platform services (monitoring, logging, shared secrets, etc.) are
# managed by the SRE team.
/platform/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Application Layers
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Development Environment Application Layer
# Changes to the dev app infra are reviewed by the Dev Team.
/apps/dev/ @AcmeLabsCloud/dev-team

# QA Environment Application Layer
# Changes to the QA app infra are reviewed by the QA Team.
/apps/qa/ @AcmeLabsCloud/qa-team

# UAT and Production Environment Application Layers
# Changes to critical UAT and Prod app infra are reviewed by the SRE team.
/apps/uat/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team
/apps/prod/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AMI Builder Layer
# Changes to AMI build pipelines (Packer templates, build scripts) are reviewed
# by the SRE team, as they are responsible for golden images.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/ami-builder/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared Modules
# Changes to reusable Terraform modules are typically managed by the SRE team
# or a dedicated platform/infra team.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/shared-modules/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Workflows
# Changes to CI/CD workflows are critical and managed by the SRE team.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.github/workflows/ @AcmeLabsCloud/sre-team
